{"id": 95, "name": "Yu Zhong", "splash": "https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/mobile-legends/images/1/10/Hero951-portrait.png/revision/latest?cb=20241021142947", "cls": ["Fighter", ""], "specialty": ["Regen", "Damage"], "difficulty": "70", "stats": ["70", "40", "70", "70"], "lanes": ["Exp Lane", ""], "story": "Yu Zhong, the reincarnation of the Black Dragon, intends to unify the Cadia Riverlands through conquest and usher in an era of prosperity.", "skills": [{"name": "Cursing Touch", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage_92/100_70130baa91b397c878074c763667da58.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 62, "tagname": "Buff", "tagrgb": "79,156,184"}], "cdcost": "", "desc": "Yu Zhong applies <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Sha Residue</span> to enemy heroes every time he deals damage to them. <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Sha Residue</span> erupts upon reaching 5 stacks on a target. Then it begins consuming 1 stack every 0.4s to deal <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span> equal to 20<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+20% Extra Physical Attack)</span> plus 2.5% of the target's lost HP to the target. Each stack consumed restores 6% of Yu Zhong's lost HP. When <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Sha Residue</span> erupts, Yu Zhong also gains 30% Movement Speed for 3s."}, {"name": "Dragon Tail", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage_92/100_059500c39711fede4fa015c651fcb1f6.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 32, "tagname": "AOE", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}], "cdcost": "CD: 6", "desc": "Yu Zhong infuses his power into his cloak and turns it into a weapon, which starts to attack nearby enemies after a short delay. The inner area of the cloak deals 220<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+100% Extra Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span>, whereas the sharpened edge deals 275% damage and applies 2 stacks of <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Sha Residue</span>."}, {"name": "Soul Grip", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage_92/100_a994b7307c97f871b488e98e31eb84de.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 22, "tagname": "Slow", "tagrgb": "205,93,109"}, {"tagid": 81, "tagname": "Mobility", "tagrgb": "162,105,198"}], "cdcost": "CD: 12", "desc": "Yu Zhong unleashes the Dragon Soul, dealing 150<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+120% Extra Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span> to all enemies in front and slowing them by 60% for 1s. \n\nUpon hitting an enemy, Yu Zhong's next Basic Attack will be enhanced, dealing 108<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+100% Total Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span>. Upon hitting multiple enemies, the enhanced Basic Attack will apply multiple stacks of <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Sha Residue</span> and deal up to 200% damage."}, {"name": "Furious Dive", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage_92/100_be320a759c57e0d449adf7afe97cdbd0.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 81, "tagname": "Mobility", "tagrgb": "162,105,198"}, {"tagid": 21, "tagname": "CC", "tagrgb": "205,93,109"}], "cdcost": "CD: 14", "desc": "Yu Zhong leaps towards the designated area with his full strength, dealing 180<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+90% Extra Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span>. He is able to dash one more time in the movement direction. \nAfter a short delay, enemies within the area of effect will be knocked airborne for 0.6s and take 180<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+90% Extra Physical Attack)</span> additional <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span>."}, {"name": "Black Dragon Form", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage_92/100_936aca894105c4c9a4ee0a7b5a472438.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 72, "tagname": "Morph", "tagrgb": "97,127,198"}, {"tagid": 62, "tagname": "Buff", "tagrgb": "79,156,184"}], "cdcost": "CD: 85", "desc": "After channeling for 0.6s, Yu Zhong transforms into his Black Dragon Form. For up to 7s, he cannot use any skills but can move freely and will knock back enemy heroes in his path while dealing 180<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+80% Total Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span>. He also gains 1000<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+200% Extra Physical Attack)</span> Max HP, becomes immune to control effects, and ignores obstacles in this form.\nUpon exiting the Black Dragon Form, Yu Zhong enters <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Dragonoid Form</span>, gaining increased range on all of his skills for 10s."}], "fullbuilds": [{"items": [{"name": "Tough Boots", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_e7045efd7cf5bcb488594a7eac3ab4e2.png"}, {"name": "War Axe", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage_2_1_60_2/100_fa1f5745cf88227722a9ff22c95c0bc4.png"}, {"name": "Queen's Wings", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_f6bab0819a3203e65eb28da7ef1c4478.png"}, {"name": "Hunter Strike", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_f523b2a5fb397bd5f37475b5f0b4fbd1.png"}, {"name": "Oracle", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_bc24b55abbbec6da408eb0ea5c37cad4.png"}, {"name": "Athena's Shield", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_d9bb48a8df64ae5065d370adca6a5153.png"}], "emblem": {"name": "Fighter", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_2153bf01770633e3251dea1f2ac6c956.png"}, "talents": [{"name": "Thrill", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_3a9b36ceebfebd89a7a79a5c386cfdda.png", "tier": 1}, {"name": "Festival of Blood", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_14e7521fcba0c60bb0128a6c3e223eaf.png", "tier": 2}, {"name": "War Cry", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage_92/100_9